  "Q00023_LidiasHeart/31524-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00023_LidiasHeart/31524-04.html",
   "quest": 23,
   "text": "Ghost of von Hellmann: This concerns Lidia's Diary? Is that right? Oh, I see! Dear traveler! For whatever little time I have left, I'll read this diary and go over the past again and again in my mind! Traveler, I shall reward you well for this diary! Dig underneath this tombstone and you will find …",
   "header": "Ghost of von Hellmann",
